Copyright 2026 Solve It Simply, Inc.

This product includes software developed at Solve It Simply, Inc.
(https://www.simply360.app).

This repository is a public reference proof that exercises the Simply360
Integration Marketplace FILE_SOURCE and FILE_DESTINATION capabilities through
Google Picker and Google's non-sensitive `drive.file` scope. It uses only
public Simply360 platform boundaries (published SDK, OAuth, webhooks,
manifests, Blueprint packages, and extension protocols). It contains no
Simply360 internal database models, worker imports, provider secrets, or
authorization logic.

